{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LT2u5AfQqZYKURtRPXMr6d","type":"tool_result","content":"- A `Dockerfile` builds the role's image; without one the local executor runs a host subprocess and the Kubernetes executor uses the default `ard-agent` image (agent CLIs, git, common linters). A role\n- Any other file in the directory (scripts, allowlists) is mounted read-only beside the prompt.\n\n```yaml\nmax_pods: 3                  # job slots shared by every loop\nexecutor: local              # local | k8s\nagent: claude                # default CLI for agent roles\nrequire_approval: true       # human adds ard:approved before a worker starts\nbudget_usd_per_day: 50       # whole repo, UTC day, blocks at spent >= cap; a role may set its own; provisional, recalibrated between Gate 1 and Gate 2\nmax_budget_usd: 5            # per job; provisional, same recalibration\nglobal_max_open: 30          # open scanner issues across all scanners\npaused: false\nintervals: { scanners: 4h, triage: 15m, workers: 5m, reviewers: 5m, merger: 5m, prwatch: 5m }\npr_watch: { pending_timeout: 2h }   # at least intervals.prwatch, at most 7d\nintake: { mode: label }     # mode: all | label; label (label mode only) defaults to ard:pending, must start with ard: and must not be one of ard's own labels\nmerge:                       # defaults written by `ard init`; the list is the only source (no floor in code)\n  protected_paths: [.github/, .ard/config.yaml, .ard/scanners/, .ard/triage/, .ard/workers/, .ard/reviewers/, \"**/CODEOWNERS\", CLAUDE.md, \"**/CLAUDE.md\", AGENTS.md, \"**/AGENTS.md\", .claude/, .mcp.json\nstale: { inactive_for: 30d, suppress_for: 90d }\n\nsidecars:\n  vpe-specs: { repo: <owner>/specs, ref: main }   # ref: branch, tag or full 40-hex SHA; default main\n\noverrides:                   # only what differs from convention\n  scanners/cve:             { every: 6h, max_open: 10, group_size: 1, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/lts:             { every: 7d, max_open: 5, group_size: 1, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/docs:            { every: 3d, max_open: 3, group_size: 10, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/error-codes:     { every: 24h, group_size: 20, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/missing-tests:   { every: 24h, max_open: 5, group_size: 10, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/trufflehog:      { every: 24h, max_open: 5, group_size: 1, autoclose: true, route: needs-human, timeout: 30m }\n  scanners/trufflehog-history: { every: 7d, max_open: 5, group_size: 1, autoclose: false, route: needs-human, timeout: 60m }\n  scanners/lint:            { every: 24h, max_open: 3, group_size: 20, autoclose: true }\n  triage/lead:              { sidecar: vpe-specs, timeout: 15m, model: claude-opus-5-5 }\n  triage/architect:         { sidecar: vpe-specs }\n  triage/engineer:          { after: [architect, product-manager, designer, documentation-planner] }\n  workers/engineer:         { tests: make test, timeout: 60m, reviewers: [security-review, eng-review] }\n  reviewers/product-manager-review: { when: { triage: [product-manager] } }\n  reviewers/license-review: { agent: kimi, when: { paths: [\"**/go.mod\", \"**/go.sum\", \"**/package.json\", \"**/package-lock.json\", \"**/npm-shrinkwrap.json\"] } }\n  reviewers/web-review: { when: { paths: [web/] } }\n```","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab11da88-bedd-4a91-847e-cd60783376a2","uuid":"c1ff2367-76cf-4b55-abfc-8e73b321bab0","timestamp":"2026-11-24T13:36:53.592Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"- A `Dockerfile` builds the role's image; without one the local executor runs a host subprocess and the Kubernetes executor uses the default `ard-agent` image (agent CLIs, git, common linters). A role\n- Any other file in the directory (scripts, allowlists) is mounted read-only beside the prompt.\n\n```yaml\nmax_pods: 3                  # job slots shared by every loop\nexecutor: local              # local | k8s\nagent: claude                # default CLI for agent roles\nrequire_approval: true       # human adds ard:approved before a worker starts\nbudget_usd_per_day: 50       # whole repo, UTC day, blocks at spent >= cap; a role may set its own; provisional, recalibrated between Gate 1 and Gate 2\nmax_budget_usd: 5            # per job; provisional, same recalibration\nglobal_max_open: 30          # open scanner issues across all scanners\npaused: false\nintervals: { scanners: 4h, triage: 15m, workers: 5m, reviewers: 5m, merger: 5m, prwatch: 5m }\npr_watch: { pending_timeout: 2h }   # at least intervals.prwatch, at most 7d\nintake: { mode: label }     # mode: all | label; label (label mode only) defaults to ard:pending, must start with ard: and must not be one of ard's own labels\nmerge:                       # defaults written by `ard init`; the list is the only source (no floor in code)\n  protected_paths: [.github/, .ard/config.yaml, .ard/scanners/, .ard/triage/, .ard/workers/, .ard/reviewers/, \"**/CODEOWNERS\", CLAUDE.md, \"**/CLAUDE.md\", AGENTS.md, \"**/AGENTS.md\", .claude/, .mcp.json\nstale: { inactive_for: 30d, suppress_for: 90d }\n\nsidecars:\n  vpe-specs: { repo: <owner>/specs, ref: main }   # ref: branch, tag or full 40-hex SHA; default main\n\noverrides:                   # only what differs from convention\n  scanners/cve:             { every: 6h, max_open: 10, group_size: 1, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/lts:             { every: 7d, max_open: 5, group_size: 1, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/docs:            { every: 3d, max_open: 3, group_size: 10, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/error-codes:     { every: 24h, group_size: 20, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/missing-tests:   { every: 24h, max_open: 5, group_size: 10, autoclose: true }\n  scanners/trufflehog:      { every: 24h, max_open: 5, group_size: 1, autoclose: true, route: needs-human, timeout: 30m }\n  scanners/trufflehog-history: { every: 7d, max_open: 5, group_size: 1, autoclose: false, route: needs-human, timeout: 60m }\n  scanners/lint:            { every: 24h, max_open: 3, group_size: 20, autoclose: true }\n  triage/lead:              { sidecar: vpe-specs, timeout: 15m, model: claude-opus-5-5 }\n  triage/architect:         { sidecar: vpe-specs }\n  triage/engineer:          { after: [architect, product-manager, designer, documentation-planner] }\n  workers/engineer:         { tests: make test, timeout: 60m, reviewers: [security-review, eng-review] }\n  reviewers/product-manager-review: { when: { triage: [product-manager] } }\n  reviewers/license-review: { agent: kimi, when: { paths: [\"**/go.mod\", \"**/go.sum\", \"**/package.json\", \"**/package-lock.json\", \"**/npm-shrinkwrap.json\"] } }\n  reviewers/web-review: { when: { paths: [web/] } }\n```","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LT2u5AfQqZYKURtRPXMr6d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
