king.\n\n### Size\nS, about 120 to 180 added lines, though under the S threshold only if the runbook stays short; call it M if it exceeds 50 lines. Files: `docs/runbooks/onboard-repo.md` (new), `docs/proposal.md`, `docs/layout.md`.\nEOF\ncat > .ard/304/triage-engineer.md <<'EOF'\n---\nrole: engineer\nstatus: done\nattempt: 1\n---\nPlans a documentation-only change: a new onboarding runbook with a worked two-repo limits example, a per-process limits and credentials note in the proposal's Rollout and Configuration sections, and a one-line layout tweak. Size M, risk low.\n\n## Open issues\n- No token-cap setting exists in the configuration or proposal today. The plan has the runbook cover the real keys (`max_pods`, `budget_usd_per_day`, `max_budget_usd`) and not invent a token-cap key; a maintainer may want a separate issue.\n- PAT support, the shared roles repo and live cluster jobs are not landed, so the runbook words them as conditional.\n- The `instances` entry name for the deployment repo could not be checked here; the worker should confirm it.\nEOF"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":275,"cache_read_input_tokens":19083,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":275},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab11da88-bedd-4a91-847e-cd60783376a2","uuid":"b0670472-c9b9-4d2f-b44f-ff5cb8da206e","timestamp":"2026-11-24T13:37:10.191Z","request_id":"req_011ChMqrkM4v4wbwX4pbeWve"}
